Generate previews by default for:

    sdn/preview/
    image_gdc/preview/
    range/gt/preview/
    range/raw_sdn/preview/
    range/image_gdc/preview/
    range/range_gdc/preview/

Preview generation should be deterministic and overwrite-safe.
If the corresponding stage is forced, its preview should also be regenerated.

