## Pointcloud requirements

Generate 64ch pointclouds by default for:

    pointcloud/raw_sdn_64ch/
    pointcloud/image_gdc_64ch/
    pointcloud/range_gdc_64ch/

These pointclouds must be generated from the corresponding 64x1024 range images, not from image-plane depth maps.

Use the same projection metadata as the range image generation.


